  (text
    "UV DRIVER: two series Vishay LEDs,200mV/3.65R=54.79mA nominal. CTRL static; no EasyScale/PWM.\nEach LED has only two electrical terminals. Cathode mark must match pin1. Local SW loop short; no HV hinge wires.\nCathode FET interrupts LED current on CTRL low; input cuts are on safety board."
    (at 40 25 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 6663890c-8bff-5e6b-8742-17caa7756880))
  (text
    "OUTPUT:4.7uF50V,100k bleeder,1M/68k monitor. Output can remain charged after light stops.\nRequire >=1uF effective output at39V/temp/age. OVP37..39V; measure switch ringing. FB/VOUT filters10k/100nF.\nNTC controller owns pullup/filter. 67L045 thermal cutoff plus separate gold lid contact form hardware loop."
    (at 40 555 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
